    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_conflict_deescalation_trigger",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-conflict-deescalation-01",
        "text": {
          "en": "The immediate trigger was the email, but the friction had been building for weeks around unclear ownership."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "محرک فوری ایمیل بود، ولی تنش چند هفته بود به خاطر مالکیت نامشخص کار جمع می‌شد."
        },
        "intent": "identify_trigger",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_conflict_deescalation_trigger",
          "c1_conflict_deescalation_friction"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "polite-language",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_conflict_deescalation_accusation",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-conflict-deescalation-01",
        "text": {
          "en": "If we respond to the accusation with another accusation, we will probably escalate the part of the conflict that is easiest to avoid."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "اگر به اتهام با اتهام جواب بدیم، احتمالاً همون بخشی از درگیری رو تشدید می‌کنیم که راحت‌تر می‌شه ازش جلوگیری کرد."
        },
        "intent": "avoid_escalation",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_conflict_deescalation_accusation",
          "c1_conflict_deescalation_deescalate"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "polite-language",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_conflict_deescalation_ack",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-conflict-deescalation-02",
        "text": {
          "en": "I can acknowledge that the delay caused real pressure without accepting the claim that anyone acted in bad faith."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "می‌تونم بپذیرم تأخیر فشار واقعی ایجاد کرده، بدون اینکه ادعای بدرفتاری عمدی رو قبول کنم."
        },
        "intent": "acknowledge_impact",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_conflict_deescalation_acknowledge",
          "c1_conflict_deescalation_accusation"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "polite-language",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_conflict_deescalation_reframe",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-conflict-deescalation-02",
        "text": {
          "en": "I would reframe the issue from 'who failed' to 'which handoff broke and how we prevent a repeat.'"
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "مسئله رو از «چه کسی شکست خورد» به «کدوم تحویل کار خراب شد و چطور تکرارش نکنیم» تغییر می‌دم."
        },
        "intent": "reframe_conflict",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_conflict_deescalation_reframe",
          "c1_conflict_deescalation_defuse"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "polite-language",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_conflict_deescalation_boundary",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-conflict-deescalation-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "De-escalation does not mean tolerating personal attacks; a clear boundary can make the conversation safer and more productive."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "تنش‌زدایی یعنی حمله شخصی رو تحمل کنیم نیست؛ مرز روشن می‌تونه گفتگو رو امن‌تر و سازنده‌تر کنه."
        },
        "intent": "set_boundary",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_conflict_deescalation_boundary",
          "c1_conflict_deescalation_deescalate"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "polite-language",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_conflict_deescalation_defuse",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-conflict-deescalation-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "A specific apology can defuse tension more effectively than a vague attempt to move on quickly."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "یک عذرخواهی مشخص می‌تونه خیلی مؤثرتر از تلاش مبهم برای زود عبور کردن، تنش رو خنثی کنه."
        },
        "intent": "defuse_tension",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_conflict_deescalation_defuse",
          "c1_conflict_deescalation_acknowledge"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "polite-language",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_conflict_deescalation_pause",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-conflict-deescalation-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "If the conversation becomes too heated to interpret each other fairly, pausing may be more constructive than pushing for immediate agreement."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "اگر بحث اون‌قدر داغ بشه که همدیگه رو منصفانه نفهمیم، مکث کردن شاید سازنده‌تر از فشار برای توافق فوری باشه."
        },
        "intent": "pause_conflict",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_conflict_deescalation_friction",
          "c1_conflict_deescalation_deescalate"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "polite-language",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_conflict_deescalation_close",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-conflict-deescalation-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "The goal is not to erase disagreement but to lower the emotional temperature enough to solve the actual problem."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "هدف حذف اختلاف نیست؛ هدف اینه که دمای احساسی رو اون‌قدر پایین بیاریم که بشه مشکل واقعی رو حل کرد."
        },
        "intent": "state_deescalation_goal",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_conflict_deescalation_deescalate",
          "c1_conflict_deescalation_reframe"
        ],
